      "text": "Thank you @mavolpi and @IndexVentures.\n\n\"Our journey with Scale has... just begun. Alex and his team will continue to grow as pioneers... in the field. If the last 12 mo are any indication of what is to come, they are headed towards a very bright future.\"\nhttps://t.co/uowY84Mfy8",
