      },
      "text": "Thank you, @daniel_levine and @Accel \n\n\"We’ve supported each other...over the last three years and created some amazing memories along the way: Scale’s office was once my basement... Alex meeting my first child... It’s been a pleasure so far.\"\n\nhttps://t.co/LsGpE1NUDE",
