          }
        ],
        "text": "This video shows point cloud data in various states, showing:\n-Raw, unannotated data\n-Scale's \"all-points\" feature\n-Photo colors projected on points\n-Completed cuboid annotations\n\nhttps://t.co/x7HthbN4nF https://t.co/2nWYVjEZZF"
      },
      {
