        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1158407524216909826",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "In this video, Scale's model attempts to label the scene on its own. The human tasker tells the tool which locations are incorrect, and the model incorporates that feedback into new labeling https://t.co/x7HthbN4nF https://t.co/t2YjPA3fej"
