          }
        ],
        "text": "This video shows a tasker putting points on top of a car and a pedestrian. Scale's tool then fills in the rest of the space. The last part of the video shows the startup's tool utilizing machine learning to identify other objects and save the tasker time https://t.co/x7HthbN4nF https://t.co/ihKFn1dDLx"
