        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1158439137973661701",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Thank you @IndexVentures  for your continued support of Scale! Excited to see where our journey takes us next! https://t.co/XsoIjFBbky"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "19720395",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T18:06:27.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158439137973661701"
        ],
        "id": "1158439137973661701",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 1,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 34,
          "quote_count": 4,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 4
        },
        "text": "Today we celebrate @scale_AI $100M Series C. What gets us most excited about their potential is that we're just in the early innings of ML/AI's adoption. Hearty congratulations to @alexandr_wang + his entire team on this impressive milestone. @mavolpi https://t.co/CTAwMGRxo5"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "33846451",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T17:07:00.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158424174278217737"
        ],
        "id": "1158424174278217737",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 1,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 30,
          "quote_count": 2,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 10
        },
        "text": "From working on @Scale_AI in our partner @Daniel_Levine's basement, to building it into the company it is today, it has been remarkable to watch @alexandr_wang and his team's journey as they pave the way for a connected, AI-powered world #AccelFamily https://t.co/yBZZ641c2t"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "67358777",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T15:59:40.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158407229437022209"
        ],
        "id": "1158407229437022209",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 2,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 62,
          "quote_count": 5,
          "reply_count": 2,
          "retweet_count": 22
        },
        "text": "Scale AI just became Silicon Valley's latest unicorn. Here's how the startup's human taskers train its models https://t.co/x7HthbN4nF"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "34713362",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T15:03:48.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158393171174449153"
        ],
        "id": "1158393171174449153",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 3,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 114,
          "quote_count": 3,
          "reply_count": 4,
          "retweet_count": 49
        },
        "text": "Scale AI, which teaches machines to see, is about to be valued at more than $1 billion. It's run by a 22-year-old https://t.co/RriP9XmQLr"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "3883259303",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T16:48:27.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158419506789617665"
        ],
        "id": "1158419506789617665",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 1,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 24,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 2
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1158407916925411331",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "So thrilled to be in business with @alexandr_wang and the rest of the @scale_AI team. Excited to work together to accelerate the development of AI applications globally. https://t.co/p47zDKFabE"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "752712449321644032",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T16:02:24.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158407916925411331"
        ],
        "id": "1158407916925411331",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 13,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 180,
          "quote_count": 11,
          "reply_count": 10,
          "retweet_count": 34
        },
        "text": "We’re proud of what we’ve built over the last three years. Today we’re pleased to announce our $100M Series C fundraise led by @FoundersFund, with participation from @Accel, @IndexVentures, @sparkcapital, @ThriveCapital, @kevin, @mikeyk and @adamdangelo. https://t.co/W4zgbZmd34"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "29890630",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T14:48:39.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1158389359428587521"
        ],
        "id": "1158389359428587521",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 29,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 2
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1158363058290528256",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Scale isn't a first derivative of the autonomy boom, the autonomy boom is a first derivative of Scale's data processing infrastructure. Critical enabling technology -- congrats Alex! And head nod to my partner @daniel_levine ... https://t.co/oQF2RP6eUU"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "817386",
        "created_at": "2019-08-05T14:35:52.000Z",
